pan style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">计算单抽<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">金币</span>收益：</span>4372000/10000=437.2</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">十一连收益：</span>437.2&nbsp;*&nbsp;11&nbsp;=&nbsp;4809.2</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">总结：5w金币的十一连综合获取4809.2金币</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><br></span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">开金币箱子考虑金币回血后，金币体力玛瑙综合收益：</span></p></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">50000 - 4809.2&nbsp;=&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">45190.8。</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\">45190.8</span>金币&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\">=&nbsp;</span>42.185&nbsp;体力<br style=\"\">等式左边转换成10w金币： 10w金币&nbsp;=&nbsp;93.348...约等于&nbsp;93.3&nbsp;点体力<br style=\"\">再考虑去玛瑙本挖玛瑙（玛瑙本30体力得&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">1400&nbsp;</span>3000</span>玛瑙），修改等式为<br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-line: line-through;\">10w金币&nbsp;=&nbsp;93.3体力&nbsp;=&nbsp;4354玛瑙</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">10w金币&nbsp;=&nbsp;93.3体力&nbsp;=&nbsp;9330玛瑙</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">抽<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">1~3星天子</span>池转换成玛瑙的<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">收益</span></span></span></span></p></div><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">10w金币&nbsp;抽天子转换成&nbsp;玛瑙4675</span></span></span></span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">总结</span></p></div><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">从玛瑙收益来看，本次玛瑙<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">本毫无</span>诚意，收益还不<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">如</span>去抽<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">1~3星天子</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span>去分解来的收益高，而且刷本需要消耗大量时间，如果刻意去刷完全亏到姥姥家。<span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">各位自己考虑其他收益：</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">A. </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><span>金币</span>开</span>体力箱子可能会出副产品。比如低星装备（低概率5星装备券），低星天子券，低星史莱姆券，低星进化石等。<br>B.&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">金币抽</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">1~3星天子</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\">，会出二星<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">，二星可以挖矿</span>（11连平均<span style=\"\">3.4375</span>个二星，转换成钻石为68.75个钻石）。<br><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-decoration-line: line-through;\">总结：垃圾玛瑙本，浪费时间！！策划SM。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">策划被冲傻了，改玛瑙收益了，从1400改到3000。现在收益是抽金币池直接分解的两倍了（笑），算是给你们花时间刷的利息吧，刷不刷自己决定。刷一百万玛瑙需要一千万金币多一点。<br></span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 1.5;\"><br></span></span></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 92835, "username": "海洋饼干", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "description": "两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山", "follow_num": 859, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "海洋超人", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 97969791, "content_num": 160, "read_num": 4509513, "like_num": 2354}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "conte